# Testing

- **Services:** Mockito, **`@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)`**; exercise branches and transaction-adjacent behavior where mocked.
- **Controllers:** **`@WebMvcTest`**; mock services and security-related beans as in existing tests; **`@WithMockUser`** when simulating authenticated roles.
- **Repositories:** **`@DataJpaTest`**; use **`flush`** / **`clear`** when asserting database-visible state vs first-level cache.
- **Integration:** **`@SpringBootTest`** only for critical paths (e.g. checkout), full wiring, keep count small.

Match patterns in existing tests under `src/test/java/com/example/ecommerce/`. See **ARCHITECTURE.md** (“Testing strategy”).
